flowchart TD
    UC["upload chunk"] --> RES{result?}
    RES -->|2xx/308| PERSIST["persist offset, next chunk"]
    RES -->|transient fail| RETRY["Result.retry backoff"]
    RES -->|4xx non-retryable| FAIL["fail + surface error"]
    PERSIST --> ALL{all sent?}
    ALL -->|yes| MARK["mark complete"]
    RETRY --> QUERY["query status, resume offset"]
    QUERY --> UC
